# First Kick — no environment variables are required.
# `npm install && npm run dev` works out of the box using the bundled static fixtures.
#
# OPTIONAL: live fixture data
#   1. Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored): cp .env.example .env.local
#   2. Set your free football-data.org key below.
#      Get one at https://www.football-data.org/client/register
#   3. Restart `npm run dev` after adding it.

# FOOTBALL_DATA_API_KEY=your_free_key_here
